{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55037","headline":"兵要望江南 占梦第二十五（京本列第十三○九首） 四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占梦第二十五（京本列第十三○九首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军梦，打（辛本、川本、京本作「大」）鼓大声鸣。\n小鼓小声（京本作「鸣」）军小胜，不鸣固守莫先（京本作「前」）征，胜负取其声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}